SM-T715 tablet: rotation tiles.

Puts Rotation (upstream's rotation lock, over omamobile-autorotate.service) back
in the catalogue and adds Rotate, a quarter turn by hand through t715-rotate. The
service is off by default, so the tile reads Locked. See docs/image/ROTATION.md.
Against omarchy-mobile 5f7ba48 and the patches before it, packages/omamobile-shell
(applied with patch -p1 in that directory).

